  "content": "\n\n<p>英文：</p>\n<p>此模組會翻譯來自 Doomsday Decoration 的方塊。（翻譯可能會有錯誤，若您發現任何問題，請在 Discord 上回報。）</p>\n<p>目前支援的語言：(1.0.6)<br>-俄文<br>-英文</p>\n<p>-越南文（感謝 nightmare ko bt j hết）</p>\n<p>-法文（感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/truyty/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Truyty</a>）</p>\n<p>-西班牙文（感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izakji/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Izakji)</a></p>\n<p>-德文（感謝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chaoscraft_hd/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChaosCraft</a>）</p>\n<p>-羅馬尼亞文（感謝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pixelplatesyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sebb Sheppherd</a>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka Library</a> 是此模組運作所必需的。</span></p>\n<p>💬 加入 Discord 伺服器以獲取更新、提供反饋、回報錯誤與建議，或參與翻譯：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>俄文：</p>\n<p>此模組會翻譯來自 Doomsday Decoration 的方塊。（翻譯可能會有錯誤，若您發現任何問題，請在 Discord 上回報。）</p>\n<p>支援的語言：(1.0.6)</p>\n<p>-俄文<br>-英文</p>\n<p>-越南文（感謝&nbsp;nightmare ko bt j hết）</p>\n<p>-法文（感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/truyty/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Truyty</a>）</p>\n<p>-西班牙文（感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izakji/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Izakji</a>）</p>\n<p>-德文（感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chaoscraft_hd/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChaosCraft</a>）</p>\n<p>-羅馬尼亞文（感謝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pixelplatesyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sebb Sheppherd</a>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此模組運作需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 函式庫</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">💬</span>加入 Discord 伺服器或 Telegram 頻道以追蹤更新、回報錯誤、提出建議或參與翻譯：</p>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
